/* iOS「设置」App 里 S2Arm 页（Root.plist）的简体中文：键是 Root.plist 里的英文原文（#316）。tests/ios_l10n_test.sh 核对一一对应 */
"Switch Mode (Restart the Game to Apply)" = "Switch 模式（改完要重开游戏）";
"Docked mode is how the Switch runs in its dock; when off, Handheld mode is used. The actual resolution and quality are up to the game; this is set separately from the compatible / high-performance run mode. Takes effect on next launch." = "主机模式对应 Switch 连接底座时的模式，关闭时使用掌机模式。实际分辨率和画质由游戏决定；与兼容 / 高性能运行模式分别设置。下次启动生效。";
"Docked Mode" = "主机模式";
"Graphics (Restart the Game to Apply)" = "画面（改完要重开游戏）";
"Scales relative to the game’s current render size and keeps widescreen. A lower scale reduces graphics load; a higher scale improves sharpness but uses more power and memory. Some textures are still processed at the game’s original size." = "相对于游戏当前渲染尺寸缩放，保留现有宽屏。降低倍率可减轻图形负载；提高倍率可改善清晰度，也会增加耗电和内存占用。部分纹理仍按游戏原始尺寸处理。";
"Render Resolution Scale" = "渲染分辨率倍率";
"1× (Native)" = "1×（原生）";
"Reduces jagged edges in the final game picture; may also soften text and detail. Off still keeps the game’s own anti-aliasing." = "对最终游戏画面减少锯齿，也可能使文字和细节变柔和。关闭后仍保留游戏自带的抗锯齿。";
"Anti-Aliasing" = "抗锯齿";
"Off" = "关闭";
"SMAA Medium" = "SMAA 中";
"SMAA High" = "SMAA 高";
"Used to scale the game picture to the screen; doesn’t change the internal render resolution." = "用于将游戏画面缩放到屏幕，不改变内部渲染分辨率。";
"Scaling Filter" = "画面缩放滤镜";
"Bilinear (Smooth)" = "双线性（平滑）";
"Nearest Neighbor (Crisp Pixels)" = "最近邻（像素清晰）";
"Sets a frame rate cap for the game picture; doesn’t unlock the game’s own frame rate limit. The actual frame rate also depends on the game and the screen’s refresh rate." = "设置游戏画面的帧率上限，不会解除游戏自身的帧率锁。实际帧率还取决于游戏表现和屏幕刷新率。";
"Frame Rate Limit" = "帧率上限";
"30 FPS" = "30 帧/秒";
"60 FPS" = "60 帧/秒";
"120 FPS" = "120 帧/秒";
"Unlimited" = "不限";
"Saves" = "存档";
"Save in the game first, then close and reopen the app. Save management opens before the game starts, where you can export a backup or import a .s2asave file from a Mac. Your current save is kept before restoring. The switch turns off once the game starts." = "先在游戏内保存，再关闭并重新打开 App。存档管理会在游戏启动前打开，可导出备份或导入 Mac 的 .s2asave 文件。恢复前会保留原存档。开始游戏后开关自动关闭。";
"Manage Saves on Next Open" = "下次打开时管理存档";
"Diagnostics" = "诊断";
"Turn this on and switch back to the game: S2Arm packs the logs from the last few runs into a diagnostics bundle and opens the share sheet (AirDrop, Save to Files, WeChat). The bundle contains no saves, keys or game files. The switch turns off after export. You can also export in game by holding four fingers on the screen for 1.5 seconds." = "打开这个开关后切回游戏，S2Arm 会把最近几次运行的日志打成诊断包，弹出分享面板（隔空投送、存到文件、微信）。诊断包不含存档、密钥和游戏文件。导出后开关会自动关上。游戏中四指同时长按屏幕 1.5 秒也能导出。";
"Export Diagnostics When the App Opens" = "打开 App 时导出诊断包";
"About This Build (Read-Only)" = "关于本包（只读）";
"Fixed when the package was built and can’t be changed: graphics mode, direct library version and build time." = "出包时就定下来了，改不了：画面模式、直连库是哪一版、什么时候出的包。";
"Graphics Mode" = "画面模式";
"Direct Library Version" = "直连库版本";
"Build Time (UTC)" = "出包时间（UTC）";
"Build ID" = "包号";
"Unknown (shown after opening a game once)" = "未知（打开一次游戏后显示）";
"Other settings are inside S2Arm: the gear at the top right of the library, or the gear at the top left in a game. Only what you may need when the app won’t open is kept here." = "其余设置都在 S2Arm 里：游戏库右上角的齿轮，或游戏里左上角的齿轮。这里只留 App 打不开时可能要改的几项。";
